title CAUM0 lands — the Mikrophone session that forgets on purpose
prompt recur baton — take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, make progress, send often, stop at custody gates
think CAUM was drawn and seated the prior round; this round lands the founding crux CAUM0 named in active-designing/20260814-020500 — the memory-that-forgets session buffer, proven pure in Rye before metal.
think Shaped mikrophone/session.rye around two bounded fixed buffers with two fates: `work` is the forgetful working buffer (captures land here, power_down zeroes it whole), `keep` is the one committed payload (commit copies work into it, power_down leaves it untouched). No heap outlives the power.
think Four verbs, each refusing by name before a byte moves: capture (NotPowered when off, BufferFull past max_samples=4096), commit (NothingToCommit on empty, AlreadyCommitted on a redundant commit over an unchanged buffer, updates the payload after fresh captures), power_down (zeroes work, clears powered), carry (returns the committed payload, empty until a commit). The copy in commit is a plain bounded loop — never a bare memcpy.
think Kept it self-contained — only std, no cross-dir imports — so the founding rung of a fresh journey directory needs no symlink seam.
obs The selftest proves all five invariants on metal: capture holds only while powered; the buffer is bounded; commit is the one deliberate act; power-down forgets the working buffer WHOLE (every byte zero) while a committed payload survives; a session powered down without a commit carries nothing. Case 4 is the sharp one — capture 'saveXY', commit at 'save', power down, and only 'save' survives while 'XY' and the whole working buffer are gone.
obs Added `mikrophone` to the TAME scan roster (bans + advise scripts + the sh comment), matching REDS #76's precedent that put the image journey on the roster, so the new firmware journey is guarded from its first file. TAME bans clean, width exit 0.
obs Real Mikrophone hardware (buying, provisioning a board) stays custody gate #2 — this rung asks no disk, no network, no key, no funds. REMEMBER's card body lags well behind the log and wants a fuller refresh; a pending door, noted honestly.
loom witness=caum_session_witness cases=5 max_samples=4096 result=GREEN
file mikrophone/session.rye CAUM0 — the memory-that-forgets session buffer (capture · commit · power_down · carry)
